+# AminGram (Fix 3 / v2.5.5): the whole string-resolution surface.
+# Python plugins and the MaterialSettingsList DEX resolve these
+# classes/members BY NAME at runtime (Chaquopy jclass / Xposed
+# reflection); R8 runs on the release build and renamed
+# org.telegram.messenger.R, so `from org.telegram.messenger
+# import R` failed on device with "cannot import name 'R'".
+# Every entry below was verified against pristine 21f7d10 and
+# against a full enumeration of the DEX's references (methods,
+# fields, and class-name strings). Targeted keeps only — no
+# blanket org.telegram.** keep. Class names already kept by M0
+# (SettingsActivity, UItem, UniversalAdapter,
+# UniversalRecyclerView, LocaleController, ApplicationLoader)
+# are not repeated here; TLRPC is already covered by upstream's
+# `-keep class org.telegram.tgnet.**`.
+-keep class org.telegram.messenger.R { *; }
+-keep class org.telegram.messenger.R$* { *; }
+-keepnames class org.telegram.ui.ChatActivity
+-keepclassmembers class org.telegram.ui.ChatActivity {
+    public static org.telegram.ui.ChatActivity of(...);
+}
